{"3938080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Birdteeth", "steam_appid": 3938080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/4f1f48e9f90394c44674a1c66aba5d1b.avif?t=1781566511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras_big/4f1f48e9f90394c44674a1c66aba5d1b.webp?t=1781566511 width=1600 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a world with hundreds of creatures you’ve never seen before. They swarm around you in flocks, examining you just as closely as you examine them. Explore various fantastical biomes, discover unique species, and become a bird whisperer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forage for seeds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/0bad6bd4689aab431b61f13593bbd615.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/0bad6bd4689aab431b61f13593bbd615.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/0bad6bd4689aab431b61f13593bbd615.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome has their own unique flora, harvest the plants, gather their seeds, and determine each bird’s personal tastes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feed the birds and earn their trust</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/ab672e0bec1b8459b5daecb49ead639b.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/ab672e0bec1b8459b5daecb49ead639b.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/ab672e0bec1b8459b5daecb49ead639b.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriending a bird is no easy task, get close enough to feed them, but beware of their easily startled nature. Sneak and hide in shrubbery to get a closer look, or simply observe from a distance! With enough of their favorite foods, maybe they’ll even come to you on their own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect… teeth?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The birds are not what they seem. They’ve watched and judged your every move, and hopefully they will determine that you are worthy of their gifts. Accept their teeth. Surely it’s a good sign?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your birds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/c2d83e8b7868ba0359bc5be5f533b847.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/c2d83e8b7868ba0359bc5be5f533b847.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/c2d83e8b7868ba0359bc5be5f533b847.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach your new friends to follow you and listen to commands. They'll be eager to use their individual skills to help you solve puzzles around the map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and shape the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/baaac742488ba39a3ec75878b73e0dd9.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/baaac742488ba39a3ec75878b73e0dd9.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/baaac742488ba39a3ec75878b73e0dd9.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The landscapes have changed drastically over the centuries, but the ancient shrines and artifacts remain. Learn how to wield their forgotten powers to mold the world around you. Perhaps by shaping your environment, you’ll unlock far more secrets than you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/e446ab307c07e9b2e601741e6354f738.avif?t=1781566511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras_big/e446ab307c07e9b2e601741e6354f738.webp?t=1781566511 width=1600 height=474 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/4f1f48e9f90394c44674a1c66aba5d1b.avif?t=1781566511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras_big/4f1f48e9f90394c44674a1c66aba5d1b.webp?t=1781566511 width=1600 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a world with hundreds of creatures you’ve never seen before. They swarm around you in flocks, examining you just as closely as you examine them. Explore various fantastical biomes, discover unique species, and become a bird whisperer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forage for seeds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/0bad6bd4689aab431b61f13593bbd615.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/0bad6bd4689aab431b61f13593bbd615.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/0bad6bd4689aab431b61f13593bbd615.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome has their own unique flora, harvest the plants, gather their seeds, and determine each bird’s personal tastes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feed the birds and earn their trust</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/ab672e0bec1b8459b5daecb49ead639b.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/ab672e0bec1b8459b5daecb49ead639b.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/ab672e0bec1b8459b5daecb49ead639b.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriending a bird is no easy task, get close enough to feed them, but beware of their easily startled nature. Sneak and hide in shrubbery to get a closer look, or simply observe from a distance! With enough of their favorite foods, maybe they’ll even come to you on their own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect… teeth?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The birds are not what they seem. They’ve watched and judged your every move, and hopefully they will determine that you are worthy of their gifts. Accept their teeth. Surely it’s a good sign?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your birds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/c2d83e8b7868ba0359bc5be5f533b847.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/c2d83e8b7868ba0359bc5be5f533b847.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/c2d83e8b7868ba0359bc5be5f533b847.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach your new friends to follow you and listen to commands. They'll be eager to use their individual skills to help you solve puzzles around the map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and shape the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/baaac742488ba39a3ec75878b73e0dd9.poster.avif?t=1781566511\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/baaac742488ba39a3ec75878b73e0dd9.webm?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/baaac742488ba39a3ec75878b73e0dd9.mp4?t=1781566511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The landscapes have changed drastically over the centuries, but the ancient shrines and artifacts remain. Learn how to wield their forgotten powers to mold the world around you. Perhaps by shaping your environment, you’ll unlock far more secrets than you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/e446ab307c07e9b2e601741e6354f738.avif?t=1781566511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras_big/e446ab307c07e9b2e601741e6354f738.webp?t=1781566511 width=1600 height=474 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A cozy, casual, puzzle game where you observe, feed, and befriend birds. Collect different species, each with their own unique traits and skills. Use the help of your feathered companions to reshape the world around you and interact with secrets and puzzles left over from the forgotten past.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/6998feaff58d427ac4a4f6bb8c38c3e6a5135d83/header.jpg?t=1781566511", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/596323d792d6953209b91ab22291d7ed45961d8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781566511", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/596323d792d6953209b91ab22291d7ed45961d8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781566511", "website": "https://stonequailgames.crd.co/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Stone Quail Games"], "publishers": ["Stone Quail Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 4149130, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/dd4095f7c7bd72ddf511f313b223bb72a9a37694/ss_dd4095f7c7bd72ddf511f313b223bb72a9a37694.600x338.jpg?t=1781566511", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/dd4095f7c7bd72ddf511f313b223bb72a9a37694/ss_dd4095f7c7bd72ddf511f313b223bb72a9a37694.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781566511"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/b76239b6f6a1268f198d83c9f936a7b8a82e0595/ss_b76239b6f6a1268f198d83c9f936a7b8a82e0595.600x338.jpg?t=1781566511", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/b76239b6f6a1268f198d83c9f936a7b8a82e0595/ss_b76239b6f6a1268f198d83c9f936a7b8a82e0595.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781566511"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/17858b6753675d28e1696475c3977121721ffe09/ss_17858b6753675d28e1696475c3977121721ffe09.600x338.jpg?t=1781566511", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/17858b6753675d28e1696475c3977121721ffe09/ss_17858b6753675d28e1696475c3977121721ffe09.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781566511"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/5616f36c9c5357126b53ea91231fff631ee0b0f2/ss_5616f36c9c5357126b53ea91231fff631ee0b0f2.600x338.jpg?t=1781566511", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/5616f36c9c5357126b53ea91231fff631ee0b0f2/ss_5616f36c9c5357126b53ea91231fff631ee0b0f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781566511"}, {"id": 4, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/990802f73ca0fba7ddad5de62647660e9893a6eb/ss_990802f73ca0fba7ddad5de62647660e9893a6eb.600x338.jpg?t=1781566511", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/990802f73ca0fba7ddad5de62647660e9893a6